            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLLAPSUS™ is a one-of-a-kind block-crunching puzzle game all about gravity manipulation and resource management!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Leon the Chameleon as you twist, tilt, turn, &amp; flip the screen as you solve your way through endless, mind-bending puzzles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">          <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/ac9f99672bdd2e75bfa8ce07ec36771c.poster.avif?t=1794120921\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/ac9f99672bdd2e75bfa8ce07ec36771c.webm?t=1794120921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/ac9f99672bdd2e75bfa8ce07ec36771c.mp4?t=1794120921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=============== </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/7e6d838adf4fdeb464f9094725fec7b8.webp?t=1794120921\" width=16 height=16 /></span> 3 Standard difficulties + 2 Unlockable difficulties; each with Zen Mode, Gravity Rush, and Time Panic variations for endless gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/967f3f2405fa1fdc6c34869fdff7a7e9.webp?t=1794120921\" width=16 height=16 /></span> 30 mind-bending Challenge Modes + 30 &quot;Plus&quot; Modes that add wild new mechanics to the game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/90031b960cb9d6c2635e501306e1be35.webp?t=1794120921\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Mission Mode with 50 objective-based puzzle ops and 50 &quot;Secret Missions&quot; to amp up the challenge </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/8037e7bbe2cc7966ec57828c8c683df3.webp?t=1794120921\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Puzzle Mode with 300 puzzles, free Daily Puzzles, and online Puzzle Maker to test your wits </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/beb498f5163611c9f5fcfad9ef0b79f7.webp?t=1794120921\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Multiplayer Battle Mode, where up to 8 players can fight it out for dominance online or locally </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/4c7953fae85ab5797ed16c9f31184ba3.webp?t=1794120921\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Over 50 accessibility options so everyone can play (including color-blind palettes, dyslexia-friendly font options, remappable controls, and more) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Best part? No Ads. No microtransactions. No loot boxes. Free DLC for life!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >===============</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/882a044a7e67077c6df7ed3832f05899.poster.avif?t=1794120921\" width=1170 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/882a044a7e67077c6df7ed3832f05899.webm?t=1794120921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/651950/extras/882a044a7e67077c6df7ed3832f05899.mp4?t=1794120921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BREAK BLOCKS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on individual blocks to break them forever. When you do, the blocks above will fall to take that space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MANAGE RESOURCES!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every click, you lose a resource called &quot;Breaks&quot;. Lose all of them and it's game over. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MATCH LINES!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get four (or more) of the same color block in a row or column to make a match. Matches give you Breaks back and push you closer and closer to level-up! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>AND HERE'S THE TWIST!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the game field in any of the four directions to change the way blocks fall... gravity is YOURS to command!</p>",
